ter</span>:        I've never been any good at writing about myself. I wish I wrote as well as you.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        I've been writing online articles since I was 15. It takes time.", "id": 3, "image": "engenn7le11ob01re2img01.jpg"}], "coverimg": "engenn7le11ob01re2img05.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "_data": [], "id": 2, "title": ""}]}]}